%% Transfer state machine: 10 states, 4 terminal.
%% Source: ARCHITECTURE.md section 11 (transition table).
%% A timeout NEVER changes state - the transfer stays put and is retried,
%% then settled by the bank's Resolve call.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INITIATED : CreateTransfer<br/>intent committed

    INITIATED --> DEBIT_SENT : persist intent<br/>before calling bank

    DEBIT_SENT --> DEBITED : bank Debit applied<br/>AND ledger debit-leg posted
    DEBIT_SENT --> FAILED : definite failure, fenced<br/>(Resolve VOIDED, ADR-024)<br/>INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS<br/>PAYER_ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND<br/>PAYER_ACCOUNT_BLOCKED
    DEBIT_SENT --> DEBIT_SENT : unknown outcome<br/>retry inline, then recovery
    DEBIT_SENT --> FAILED : Resolve returned VOIDED<br/>DEBIT_NOT_CONFIRMED

    DEBITED --> CREDIT_SENT : persist intent<br/>before calling bank

    CREDIT_SENT --> CREDITED : bank Credit applied<br/>AND ledger credit-leg posted
    CREDIT_SENT --> REVERSING : definite failure, fenced<br/>(Resolve VOIDED, ADR-024)<br/>PAYEE_ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND<br/>PAYEE_ACCOUNT_BLOCKED
    CREDIT_SENT --> CREDIT_SENT : unknown outcome<br/>retry inline, then recovery
    CREDIT_SENT --> REVERSING : Resolve returned VOIDED<br/>CREDIT_NOT_CONFIRMED

    CREDITED --> SUCCESS : finalize

    REVERSING --> REVERSED : ReverseDebit applied<br/>AND reversal journal posted
    REVERSING --> REVERSING : unknown outcome<br/>retried with backoff until it works
    REVERSING --> NEEDS_MANUAL_REVIEW : BUG only<br/>BANK_INVARIANT_VIOLATION

    DEBIT_SENT --> NEEDS_MANUAL_REVIEW : BUG / LEDGER_REJECTED
    CREDIT_SENT --> NEEDS_MANUAL_REVIEW : BUG / LEDGER_REJECTED
    note right of NEEDS_MANUAL_REVIEW
        Also reached from any
        non-terminal state after
        MAX_RECOVERY_ATTEMPTS (20)
        with reason RECOVERY_EXHAUSTED.
        The chaos test requires ZERO
        transfers reach this state.
    end note

    SUCCESS --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    REVERSED --> [*]
    NEEDS_MANUAL_REVIEW --> [*]
